<title>CANADA: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF WOMEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF WOMEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE LOUISE, Canada 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
